      "writtenOn": "2022-08-05T15:25:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi sir:\n\nDo you mean trace_android_rvh_check_preempt_wakeup?\n\nWe must clear the lock_start_time of tsk if the process hold the lock for a \"long\" time so we must try us best early to call hooks to clear it, which check_preempt_wakeup return since some other reasons.",
